# Uploaded by `vercel` CLI deploys from the repo root (the projects set Root
# Directory to TopBlast/ or whitepaper/). Env files hold production secrets —
# the DB URI and payout keys — and Next.js would read them at build time, so
# they must never leave this machine. Production env comes from Vercel.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/env.example.txt

# Build output and dependencies are rebuilt on Vercel.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

.git
.vercel
